<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Earbud controls (gesture config). A pointing finger with two tap arcs above it:
  the finger says "touch", the arcs say "the tap is what is being configured".

  Same house style as the other row icons: 24dp viewport, a single white path,
  tinted per theme in code (ThemeRes.tint). Do NOT bake a colour in — on the light
  theme a baked white glyph is invisible.
-->
